{"id":"v144qoxqkfjcrg96fv0z1it6d","title":"巧克力的历史与制作工艺","originalTitle":"闲话一块巧克力","summary":"巧克力的原料可可豆最早被玛雅人视为圣物，经过阿兹台克人改良后成为宫廷奢侈品。现代巧克力的制作工艺复杂，包括混合、精磨、精炼和调温等步骤，确保可可脂晶型稳定，从而获得光泽、脆声和入口即化的口感。巧克力不仅是一种食品，还承载着丰富的文化意义，象征着甜蜜、时尚与爱情。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=437607&do=blog&id=1560775"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T01:17:20.420Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T01:17:20.420Z","category":"life-science","tags":["论文发表"],"score":12,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}